{
  "//": "Merged into the project .claude/settings.json by /iris-legacy:bootstrap. Allowed without a prompt: the MCP tools that only read (annotated readOnly by iris-interop-dev), running tests, and read-only git. iris_execute, iris_doc (it can write) and iris_compile still ask.",
